{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584260/extras/2229e950d1840254e6a8575d858ca5ea.avif?t=1767621412\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584260/extras_big/2229e950d1840254e6a8575d858ca5ea.avif?t=1767621412 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fogreaver</strong> is an intense survival-action game set in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by zombies. As a lone survivor, you must fight through hordes of the undead, unlocking new maps as you progress. Each level challenges you to eliminate all zombies to mark the area as cleared and unlock the next battleground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584260/extras/753a790268464dae25a79ba100041aa8.poster.avif?t=1767621412\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584260/extras/753a790268464dae25a79ba100041aa8.webm?t=1767621412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a <strong>map selection system</strong>, where levels remain locked until the previous one is completed. With every successful mission, you earn progression, pushing further into the depths of the outbreak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584260/extras/b6f931e827f2cbfd935bc1e9fae509b9.poster.avif?t=1767621412\" width=1170 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584260/extras/b6f931e827f2cbfd935bc1e9fae509b9.webm?t=1767621412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both casual and hardcore players, <strong>Fogreaver</strong> combines <strong>fast-paced combat, strategic progression, and immersive gameplay</strong>, making each fight for survival more intense than the last.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584260?t=1767621412","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584260?t=1767621412","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584260/17ec9c1cd5bcb72b3696ec348d6fa2af52a285dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767621412","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584260/17ec9c1cd5bcb72b3696ec348d6fa2af52a285dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767621412","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4101260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584260/extras/2229e950d1840254e6a8575d858ca5ea.avif?t=1767621412\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584260/extras_big/2229e950d1840254e6a8575d858ca5ea.avif?t=1767621412 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fogreaver</strong> is an intense survival-action game set in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by zombies. As a lone survivor, you must fight through hordes of the undead, unlocking new maps as you progress. Each level challenges you to eliminate all zombies to mark the area as cleared and unlock the next battleground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584260/extras/753a790268464dae25a79ba100041aa8.poster.avif?t=1767621412\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584260/extras/753a790268464dae25a79ba100041aa8.webm?t=1767621412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a <strong>map selection system</strong>, where levels remain locked until the previous one is completed. With every successful mission, you earn progression, pushing further into the depths of the outbreak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584260/extras/b6f931e827f2cbfd935bc1e9fae509b9.poster.avif?t=1767621412\" width=1170 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584260/extras/b6f931e827f2cbfd935bc1e9fae509b9.webm?t=1767621412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both casual and hardcore players, <strong>Fogreaver</strong> combines <strong>fast-paced combat, strategic progression, and immersive gameplay</strong>, making each fight for survival more intense than the last.</p>","developers":["Trinnky's Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584260/ef5d82dbfd5c25045907ebb256a49a031a7d8b9e/header.jpg?t=1767621412","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</